<title>USA: FOB Gulf Grain - Corn mostly up, soy steady.</title>
<headline>FOB Gulf Grain - Corn mostly up, soy steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOB Gulf corn basis values were mostly higher on Thursday while soybean positions were steady.</p>
<p>CBOT corn and soybean prices ended on the downside and &quot;there was not a lot going on,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>In export news, Taiwan's Hui Shung Group late on Thursday bought a combined shipment of 38,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans and 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said. Shipment was slated for November 10-25, U.S. Gulf and/or November 26-December 10, Pacific Northwest.  </p>
